{
 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "In nineteen seventy-five,",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 1.636
  },
  {
   "text": "a man got rich selling rocks.",
   "start": 1.636,
   "end": 3.296
  },
  {
   "text": "As pets.",
   "start": 3.296,
   "end": 3.729
  },
  {
   "text": "It started in a California bar.",
   "start": 4.186,
   "end": 6.58
  },
  {
   "text": "His friends were complaining about their pets.",
   "start": 6.6,
   "end": 9.31
  },
  {
   "text": "The feeding.",
   "start": 9.79,
   "end": 10.56
  },
  {
   "text": "The mess.",
   "start": 10.6,
   "end": 11.16
  },
  {
   "text": "So he joked that the perfect pet was a rock.",
   "start": 11.68,
   "end": 14.091
  },
  {
   "text": "Then he actually sold one.",
   "start": 14.555,
   "end": 16.32
  },
  {
   "text": "He bought smooth stones from a Mexican beach,",
   "start": 16.74,
   "end": 19.08
  },
  {
   "text": "for a penny each.",
   "start": 19.1,
   "end": 20.16
  },
  {
   "text": "Each one came in a cardboard pet carrier,",
   "start": 20.483,
   "end": 22.541
  },
  {
   "text": "with straw,",
   "start": 22.541,
   "end": 23.239
  },
  {
   "text": "and air holes to breathe.",
   "start": 23.239,
   "end": 24.487
  },
  {
   "text": "Plus a training manual.",
   "start": 24.908,
   "end": 26.4
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Sit\" and \"stay\" were easy.",
   "start": 26.43,
   "end": 28.0
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Roll over\" needed a little help.",
   "start": 28.47,
   "end": 30.31
  },
  {
   "text": "Price: three ninety-five.",
   "start": 30.736,
   "end": 32.36
  },
  {
   "text": "By Christmas,",
   "start": 32.76,
   "end": 33.62
  },
  {
   "text": "over a million had sold.",
   "start": 33.64,
   "end": 35.06
  },
  {
   "text": "He named his company Rock Bottom Productions.",
   "start": 35.61,
   "end": 38.19
  },
  {
   "text": "Luckily, it made him a millionaire.",
   "start": 38.273,
   "end": 39.963
  },
  {
   "text": "Unluckily,",
   "start": 40.392,
   "end": 40.98
  },
  {
   "text": "by February,",
   "start": 41.0,
   "end": 41.92
  },
  {
   "text": "his pets were on sale.",
   "start": 42.24,
   "end": 43.39
  },
  {
   "text": "A million people paid for a friend who can't do anything.",
   "start": 43.757,
   "end": 46.764
  },
  {
   "text": "Because sometimes,",
   "start": 47.168,
   "end": 48.03
  },
  {
   "text": "you just want something that's yours.",
   "start": 48.03,
   "end": 49.825
  },
  {
   "text": "A rock will never leave you.",
   "start": 50.245,
   "end": 51.512
  },
  {
   "text": "It will never say good morning,",
   "start": 51.512,
   "end": 53.37
  },
  {
   "text": "either.",
   "start": 53.37,
   "end": 53.715
  },
  {
   "text": "That's why we made Feeloy.",
   "start": 54.132,
   "end": 55.72
  },
  {
   "text": "Jenny listens,",
   "start": 56.0,
   "end": 56.78
  },
  {
   "text": "remembers your day,",
   "start": 56.8,
   "end": 57.97
  },
  {
   "text": "and actually talks back.",
   "start": 58.12,
   "end": 59.56
  },
  {
   "text": "Search Feeloy on the App Store.",
   "start": 59.873,
   "end": 61.337
  }
 ]
}